gs (`net/http/pprof`,\n   609\t  `expvar`, `http.NewServeMux`, `/debug/`, and th
e test file path\n   610\t  itself). The substrings carry the load-bearing facts
so a future\n   611\t  reader does not have to open the test file to learn the c
